                        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                            I implemented several differential equation solvers and compared them on a predator-prey system.
                            The model is the Lotka-Volterra equations, with external forcing functions that stand in for migration.
                            For each method I measured accuracy, speed and stability.
                        </p>
