                                <li>• Modeling a predator-prey ecosystem</li>
                                <li>• Lotka-Volterra differential equations</li>
                                <li>• Forcing functions for migration in and out</li>
                                <li>• Two test scenarios</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Technical Implementation</h4>
                            <ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1">
                                <li>• Euler's method, written by me</li>
                                <li>• 7 numerical solvers compared</li>
